WEBVTT

00:07:29.069 --> 00:07:32.072
So compare these to our concrete,

00:07:32.114 --> 00:07:35.451
steel and glass buildings
that are air conditioned

00:07:35.493 --> 00:07:37.578
and that have sealed windows

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:42.416
that basically make our cities
into heat traps

00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:45.002
compounding instead
of solving the problem.

00:07:45.336 --> 00:07:49.256
So, what we really need to do

00:07:49.298 --> 00:07:54.970
is we need to radically
rethink and redesign

00:07:55.012 --> 00:07:57.139
our urban environments

00:07:57.181 --> 00:08:00.059
away from the logic of modernity,